    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Easy Panel for Contact Form 7 is a powerful and easy to use – no setup needed &#8211; data analytics plugin. originally created for <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">Contact Form 7</a>, designed to visually understand whats happening with your contact forms at a glance.</p>\n<p>Zero setup one click and its ready to go once you install it. Accurate stats about your contact forms without all the extra stuff, plain and simple.</p>\n<p>After activation of the plugin, you&#8217;ll find <strong>Easy Panel CF7 Dasboard</strong> on the WordPress admin screen menu. All your website contact forms are listed there as dashboard pages.</p>\n<h4>Privacy Notices</h4>\n<p>This plugin does not store any personal data.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the entire <code>easy-panel-for-contact-form-7</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "An easy going visual message data analytics plugin for Contact Form 7.",
    "description": "<p>Easy Panel for Contact Form 7 is a powerful and easy to use – no setup needed &#8211; data analytics plugin. originally created for <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">Contact Form 7</a>, designed to visually understand whats happening with your contact forms at a glance.</p>\n<p>Zero setup one click and its ready to go once you install it. Accurate stats about your contact forms without all the extra stuff, plain and simple.</p>\n<p>After activation of the plugin, you&#8217;ll find <strong>Easy Panel CF7 Dasboard</strong> on the WordPress admin screen menu. All your website contact forms are listed there as dashboard pages.</p>\n<h4>Privacy Notices</h4>\n<p>This plugin does not store any personal data.</p>\n",
